### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Ingest sample document
POST http://localhost:3000/rag/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "finance-1",
  "title": "Finance Notes",
  "content": "The invoice payment is pending approval by finance.",
  "metadata": {
    "department": "finance"
  }
}

### Ask with metadata filter
POST http://localhost:3000/rag/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the invoice payment status?",
  "topK": 5,
  "filters": {
    "department": "finance"
  }
}
